Package: ptyxis-theme-bench
Version: 1.3.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: ptyxis
Maintainer: Kazunori Ueda <kazunori.ueda.ku@gmail.com>
Description: Visual theme editor for the Ptyxis terminal
 A native GTK4/libadwaita app for designing Ptyxis terminal color
 palettes (light and dark variants, titlebar tinting, ANSI colors,
 font) with a live preview, applying changes directly via GSettings
 and .palette files — no manual editing or copy/paste required.
